    "title": "M1 core contract subset",
    "version": "0.0.3-draft",
    "description": "Backend draft curated by Orbit; design only, no validation or runtime tests. Policies deferred; SEC01–09 open. Not full B04 coverage. 1000-character text bound proposed engineering cap, not approved university policy. Result lacks full UI receipt DTO; read/list/catalogue/intent issuance and broader workflows outstanding."
